# =====================
# Python interpreter
# Used by config/tcp.php + config/rs485.php (the meter "Test connection" button)
# to run connector/*.py via shell_exec, as the account Apache runs under.
# Give a FULL path to python.exe — a per-user Python install is not on the
# service account's PATH, and even the "py" launcher can't see it.
# Single-quote the value so backslashes stay literal (phpdotenv chokes on
# unescaped "\U" etc. inside double quotes). Forward slashes also work.
# Linux/macOS: PYTHON_BIN=python3
# =====================
PYTHON_BIN='C:\Users\Admin001\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python310\python.exe'


